  "body": "Positioned within one of Takapuna's hidden coastal pockets, this architectural, single level penthouse at the award winning Napier Lane Apartments, delivers an elevated lifestyle just moments from the beach and vibrant  town centre.  Enjoy the perfect blend of seaside calm and urban convenience with cafes, restaurants, boutique shopping, Sunday Farmers market, movie theatre and essential amenities all within easy reach.  \r\n\r\nThe CBD is a short drive or bus ride over the bridge with Devonport nearby for scenic ferry access. Set amongst the iconic backdrop of Rangitoto Island and the Waitemata Harbour, this residence is a true seaside sanctuary. Vaulted ceilings, honed block detailing and striking architectural lines create a timeless contemporary interior, while the louvred loggia extends the living outdoors for year round enjoyment. A gas fireplace anchors the lounge, complemented by premium, sustainably considered finishes.  The thoughtful layout includes two double bedrooms, a fitted study, two luxurious bathrooms, lift access, two secure car parks and generous storage. Privately positioned, north east facing and bathed in sunlight, this freehold penthouse reimagines coastal living with style and sophistication.  \r\n\r\nCall Alison Parker from New Zealand Sotheby's International Realty today to view on +64 21 983 533.",
